{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-scrolling 2D rhythm game featuring an innovative \u201cmelody puzzle\u201d mechanic. Players switch between rhythm tapping and melody-based puzzles to unlock stages and memory fragments, gradually uncovering the truth behind a monstrous invasion. The game presents a richly atmospheric medieval fantasy world with hand-drawn 2D art and original music. Its standout feature is the melody-centered puzzle gameplay combined with multi-character perspective storytelling, revealing different emotions and truths behind the same events, delivering powerful narrative twists and emotional impact for a unique immersive experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619740?t=1749532903","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619740?t=1749532903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619740/2e6c3408606a79404910baf265367dc6afa285ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749532903","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619740/2e6c3408606a79404910baf265367dc6afa285ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749532903","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-scrolling 2D rhythm game featuring an innovative \u201cmelody puzzle\u201d mechanic. Players switch between rhythm tapping and melody-based puzzles to unlock stages and memory fragments, gradually uncovering the truth behind a monstrous invasion. The game presents a richly atmospheric medieval fantasy world with hand-drawn 2D art and original music. Its standout feature is the melody-centered puzzle gameplay combined with multi-character perspective storytelling, revealing different emotions and truths behind the same events, delivering powerful narr